        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128940/extras/04e2892c362525128b8a4762cb690346.avif?t=1763485149\" width=780 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom stands on the brink of ruin. Whispers of doom echo through the streets, yet no one knows the truth. Beneath the castle, in the depths long consigned to oblivion, something stirs. An ancient darkness, thought to be sealed away forever, awakens once more—and you are the only one who can uncover its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Rune Ark</strong>, strategy and storytelling intertwine in a unique fusion of <strong>Match-3 combat</strong> and dungeon-crawling RPG mechanics. You play as a young squire, eager to prove your worth. But when you stumble upon something that was never meant to be found, your journey shifts from one of ambition to a desperate fight for survival—and for the fate of the kingdom itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128940/extras/b561b05e0e361bf6ad15241b0f535ba1.poster.avif?t=1763485149\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128940/extras/b561b05e0e361bf6ad15241b0f535ba1.webm?t=1763485149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128940/extras/b561b05e0e361bf6ad15241b0f535ba1.mp4?t=1763485149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every descent into the abyss presents new dangers and forgotten truths. Every battle is a test of both skill and will. <strong>Match tiles to unleash ancient powers, unravel hidden mysteries, and carve your path through the shifting depths</strong>. Procedurally generated dungeons hide more than just threats—they conceal choices. Each path you take shapes your story, forging alliances, stirring rivalries, and leading to multiple fates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you uncover the truth of the Rune Ark before the darkness consumes you? Will you rise as a hero, or vanish into history as just another lost soul?</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128940/extras/c57a6685eec323903837e345d5451dcc.avif?t=1763485149\" width=780 height=90 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Match-3 Combat:</strong> Solve intricate puzzles to attack, block, and unleash powerful abilities in dynamic battles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven RPG:</strong> Experience a gripping story where your choices affect the kingdom’s fate and lead to multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Dungeons:</strong> Each descent offers new challenges, enemies, and loot, ensuring high replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Progression:</strong> Upgrade abilities, craft items, and forge alliances to survive the horrors below.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128940/extras/2488e95d336ab6ef6583182de0705e47.poster.avif?t=1763485149\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128940/extras/2488e95d336ab6ef6583182de0705e47.webm?t=1763485149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128940/extras/2488e95d336ab6ef6583182de0705e47.mp4?t=1763485149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Storytelling:</strong> Influence the world through visual novel-style dialogue and deep character interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Fantasy Atmosphere:</strong> Stunning hand-crafted environments and an immersive soundtrack bring the kingdom’s mystery to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128940/extras/1585085e192bfe8f9935ca69d6058785.poster.avif?t=1763485149\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128940/extras/1585085e192bfe8f9935ca69d6058785.webm?t=1763485149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128940/extras/1585085e192bfe8f9935ca69d6058785.mp4?t=1763485149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself—<i>Rune Ark</i> is more than a puzzle game. It’s a test of strategy, resilience, and the choices that define a hero.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128940/extras/04e2892c362525128b8a4762cb690346.avif?t=1763485149\" width=780 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom stands on the brink of ruin. Whispers of doom echo through the streets, yet no one knows the truth. Beneath the castle, in the depths long consigned to oblivion, something stirs. An ancient darkness, thought to be sealed away forever, awakens once more—and you are the only one who can uncover its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Rune Ark</strong>, strategy and storytelling intertwine in a unique fusion of <strong>Match-3 combat</strong> and dungeon-crawling RPG mechanics. You play as a young squire, eager to prove your worth. But when you stumble upon something that was never meant to be found, your journey shifts from one of ambition to a desperate fight for survival—and for the fate of the kingdom itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128940/extras/b561b05e0e361bf6ad15241b0f535ba1.poster.avif?t=1763485149\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128940/extras/b561b05e0e361bf6ad15241b0f535ba1.webm?t=1763485149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128940/extras/b561b05e0e361bf6ad15241b0f535ba1.mp4?t=1763485149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every descent into the abyss presents new dangers and forgotten truths. Every battle is a test of both skill and will. <strong>Match tiles to unleash ancient powers, unravel hidden mysteries, and carve your path through the shifting depths</strong>. Procedurally generated dungeons hide more than just threats—they conceal choices. Each path you take shapes your story, forging alliances, stirring rivalries, and leading to multiple fates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you uncover the truth of the Rune Ark before the darkness consumes you? Will you rise as a hero, or vanish into history as just another lost soul?</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128940/extras/c57a6685eec323903837e345d5451dcc.avif?t=1763485149\" width=780 height=90 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Match-3 Combat:</strong> Solve intricate puzzles to attack, block, and unleash powerful abilities in dynamic battles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-Driven RPG:</strong> Experience a gripping story where your choices affect the kingdom’s fate and lead to multiple endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Dungeons:</strong> Each descent offers new challenges, enemies, and loot, ensuring high replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Progression:</strong> Upgrade abilities, craft items, and forge alliances to survive the horrors below.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128940/extras/2488e95d336ab6ef6583182de0705e47.poster.avif?t=1763485149\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128940/extras/2488e95d336ab6ef6583182de0705e47.webm?t=1763485149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128940/extras/2488e95d336ab6ef6583182de0705e47.mp4?t=1763485149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Storytelling:</strong> Influence the world through visual novel-style dialogue and deep character interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Fantasy Atmosphere:</strong> Stunning hand-crafted environments and an immersive soundtrack bring the kingdom’s mystery to life.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128940/extras/1585085e192bfe8f9935ca69d6058785.poster.avif?t=1763485149\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128940/extras/1585085e192bfe8f9935ca69d6058785.webm?t=1763485149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3128940/extras/1585085e192bfe8f9935ca69d6058785.mp4?t=1763485149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare yourself—<i>Rune Ark</i> is more than a puzzle game. It’s a test of strategy, resilience, and the choices that define a hero.</p>",
